 * 1536]/ [(64X<sup>2</sup>  -  1)(64  -  X<sup>2</sup>)]</p><p>=&gt; 1536 </p>", "solution_hi": "<p>[(X<sup>2 </sup> -  1/64) * (1  -  X<sup>2</sup>/64)/(X  -  1/8)(1  -  X/8)] * [1536/(X + 1/8)(1 + X/8)]</p><p>=&gt; 64/ (64 * 64) * [(64X<sup>2</sup>  -  1)(64  -  X<sup>2</sup>)/ (8X  -  1)(8  -  X)]/ [1536 * 64/(8X + 1)(8 + X)]</p><p>=&gt; [64X<sup>2</sup>  -  1)(64  -  X<sup>2</sup>) * 1536]/ [(64X<sup>2</sup>  -  1)(64  -  X<sup>2</sup>)]</p><p>=&gt; 1536 </p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p><div>&nbsp;The value of 6&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">1", "q_hi": "<p><div>6 <div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">1", "options_en": ["7 and 10", "10 and 13", "14 and 17", "18 and 21"], "options_hi": ["7 &#2324;&#2352; 10", "10 &#2324;&#2352; 13", "14 &#2324;&#2352; 17", "18 &#2324;&#2352; 21"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p><img width=184 height=73 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p15359/image056.png\"></p><p><img width=164 height=73 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p15359/image057.png\"></p><p><img width=168 height=41 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p15359/image058.png\"></p><p><img width=99 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p15359/image059.png\"></p><p><img width=45 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p15359/image060.png\"></p><p><img width=55 height=17 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p15359/image061.png\"></p>", "solution_hi": "<p><img width=184 height=73 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p15359/image056.png\"></p><p><img width=164 height=73 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p15359/image057.png\"></p><p><img width=168 height=41 src=\"https://u1.oliveb