rd.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23007/image011.png\"></p><p><img width=55 height=16 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23007/image012.png\"></p><p><img width=41 height=17 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23007/image013.png\"></p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p><div><div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">1", "q_hi": "<p><div><div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">1", "options_en": ["0", "1", "-1", "1/2"], "options_hi": ["0", "1", "-1", "1/2"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>1/(x-y) (y-z) + 1/(y-z) (z-x) + 1/ (z-x) (x-y)</p><p>Taking LCM, we get -</p><p>= (z - x + x - y + y - z) / (x-y) (y-z) (z-x)</p><p>= 0/(x-y) (y-z) (z-x)</p><p>= 0</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>1/(x-y) (y-z) + 1/(y-z) (z-x) + 1/ (z-x) (x-y)</p><p>Taking LCM, we get -</p><p>= (z - x + x - y + y - z) / (x-y) (y-z) (z-x)</p><p>= 0/(x-y) (y-z) (z-x)</p><p>= 0</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>What will be the simplified form of the given expression: [(5a + b)<sup>3</sup>  -  c<sup>3</sup>]</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2306;&#2332;&#2325; &#2325;&#2366; &#2360;&#2352;&#2354;&#2368;&#2325;&#2371;&#2340; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2379;&#2327;&#2366;: [(5a + b)<sup>3</sup> - c<sup>3</sup>]</p>", "options_en": ["(5a + b + c)(25a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> - c<sup>2</sup> - c(5a + b))", "(5a + b - c)(25a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup> + 10ab + c(5a + b))", "(25a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup> + c(5a + b))", "(25a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> - c<sup>2</sup> - c(5a - b))"], "options_hi": ["(5a + b + c)(25a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> - c<sup>2</sup> - c(5a + b))", "(5a + b - c)(25a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup> + 10ab + c(