>54 + 265  -  21 + 14  X  2 &div; 4 = ?</p><p>319 - 21 + 7 = ?</p><p>Hence, ? = 305</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Simplify:</p><p><div><div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">30", "q_hi": "<p>&#2360;&#2352;&#2354;&#2368;&#2325;&#2371;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;:</p><p><div><div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">30", "options_en": ["41/72", "37/72", "19/24", "23/24"], "options_hi": ["41/72", "37/72", "19/24", "23/24"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p><img width=211 height=44 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p24804/image015.png\"></p><p><img width=192 height=41 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p24804/image016.png\"></p><p><img width=137 height=41 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p24804/image017.png\"></p><p><img width=52 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p24804/image018.png\"></p><p><img width=36 height=36 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p24804/image019.png\"></p>", "solution_hi": "<p><img width=211 height=44 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p24804/image015.png\"></p><p><img width=192 height=41 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p24804/image016.png\"></p><p><img width=137 height=41 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p24804/image017.png\"></p><p><img width=52 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p24804/image018.png\"></p><p><img width=36 height=36 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p24804/image019.png\"></p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>What is the value of 3 &#247; 3 of 3 + 2 &#247; 4 + (4 &#215; 2 - 2) &#247; 12 + 4?</p><p></p>", "q_hi": "<p>3 &div; 3 &#2325;&#2366; 3 + 2 &div; 4 + (4  X  2 - 2) &div;